version: v1.0.05
date-released: 2025-06-15
abstract: >
  AutoTAB is an automated tracking algorithm for detecting and analyzing
  bipolar magnetic regions (BMRs) from full-disk solar magnetograms.
  It enables statistical studies of magnetic flux emergence, tilt angles,
  and evolution across solar cycles.
